/target
/tmp/
/.claude/settings.local.json
rust_out
librust_out.rlib

# Snapshot test failure artifacts (regenerated on demand; never committed).
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.actual.png
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.diff.png
# Per-backend regen output directories — working files; shared/ is the source of truth.
**/tests/snapshots/auto/
**/tests/snapshots/vulkan/
**/tests/snapshots/dx12/
**/tests/snapshots/metal/

# Agent-internal progress state: local-only handoff artefacts spanning the
# task -> PR -> merge journey. Created by /task, extended by /pr-commented,
# deleted by /pr-merged. Never committed.
/ai-docs/plans/**/*.progress.md
/ai-docs/pr-comments/
# Parked progress files: the parallel-PR workaround documented in
# ai-docs/learnings.md. When a /task-tracked PR is in-flight and a second
# /task must start, the in-flight progress file is renamed to
# *.progress.md.parked so /task's active-task probe (`ls
# ai-docs/plans/*.progress.md`) does not match it. Restored to its bare
# name when the second PR merges.
/ai-docs/plans/**/*.progress.md.parked
# /triage runs persist resume state to ai-docs/triage/triage-YYYY-MM-DD.progress.md.
# Created by the triage-runner subagent at Phase 1.5, deleted at Phase 8.
/ai-docs/triage/**/*.progress.md
# /triage umbrella-body staging files: Written by the runner at Phase 7.5
# sub-step 4 (gh issue edit --body-file source), deleted via rm -f after push-back.
/ai-docs/triage/**/umbrella-*.body.md
# /pr-ci-failed fallback progress files (when invoked on a PR not produced by /task).
# Created by the skill at Step 1, deleted by /pr-merged. Never committed.
/ai-docs/ci-fixes/
# /dependabot-pr progress files (per-PR, since Dependabot PRs are never /task-tracked).
# Created by the skill at Step 1; deleted by /pr-merged on PR merge. Never committed.
/ai-docs/dependabot/
# /master-ci-failed progress files (keyed by failing run-id, since no PR exists at entry).
# Created by the skill at Step 1, deleted by /pr-merged via the new **Tracked in run:**
# probe in scripts/cleanup-progress.sh. Never committed.
/ai-docs/master-ci/

# Claude Code runtime scheduler state (lock file for ScheduleWakeup).
# Local-only; never committed.
/.claude/*.lock
